      50.88,
      403.48,
      286.67,
      480.31
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      481.75,
      286.73,
      567.92
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired: The following allotment of land situated in the village of Velapura Kalutara in Grama Niladari division of 725 Kalutara South, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kalutara in the District of Kalutara in Western Province and marked in Surveyor General\u2019s Plan No. P.P.K. 4545 and contains in Extent 0.1335 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      569.12,
      305.8,
      639.68
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 Name of Land: Mankattawatta; Description: Garden Two Permanent Buildings; Claiments: Chief Manager (Property) Head Office,, Bank of Ceylon, Colombo 01; Extent: 0.1335 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      641.12,
      286.66,
      720.08
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Kalutara on the 29th day of February, 2016 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.16,
      539.64,
      425.12
    ],
    "text": "on or before the 23rd day of February, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. You should present relevant Deeds, Plans, and other Documents to prove ownership to the land on the inquiry date.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
